OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FIt's another busy day for the
OL,7,     Fcasualty team with patient numbers
OL,8,     Funusually high. Sister Rachel is
OL,9,     Frunning the shift, and she's under
OL,10,     Fpressure with a shortage of
OL,11,     Fcubicles.
OL,12,G2100 999: Killer On The Line
OL,13,     FIn 2011, Julie Dixon murdered her
OL,14,     Ffiance David Twigg by locking him
OL,15,     Fin a cupboard and starting a fire,
OL,16,     Fbut told the police that it was
OL,17,     Fpart of a suicide pact.
