OL,9,     Fspreads into his heart, consultant
OL,10,     Furological surgeons must undertake
OL,11,     Fa radical plan to remove the
OL,12,     Ftumour.
OL,13,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,14,     FThe sadistic murder of Wendy
OL,15,     FSpeakes shocked the city of
OL,16,     FWakefield, with evidence
OL,17,     Fsuggesting that a man with a
OL,18,     Ftwisted fetish was on the loose
OL,19,     Fand could kill again.
